h threat model §4.4 | VM Runtime | implemented uncommitted 2026-10-16: explicit \"'`:yin.k/admitted` name/address gate before attach; sender admission dropped on restore; pending Architect review | P1 |\n| Composition fetch loop per-run lease and budget absent | fetch threat model §4.3; reserved `:lease` policy | composition | outside module-pins slice; no fetch loop added | P2 |\n'\"''';open(p,'w').write(s)\np='docs/design/yin.vm.ucf-revisions.md';s=open(p).read();s+='''\n**2026-10-16, I-8 (module-pins slice, partial; R4 only).** Lower now\nrequires composition-supplied \"'`:yin.k/admitted {name manifest-address}`\nfor every carried install child, default empty, before attaching streams;\nrestore drops the sender'\"'s admission decision fields. No row shape or\nfixture address changes in this partial slice. The module-pin carrier,\nhost-profile schema and their fixture re-mint are blocked pending the\nArchitect's decision on where host-module export profiles are recorded.\nNo compatibility promise is added.\n''';open(p,'w').write(s)\nPY\ntail -8 /tmp/module-pins-focused.log\"","aggregated_output":"counterexample-search random values 250 states: {:numbered 248, :refused 2, :max-work 395103} failures: 0\ncounterexample-search frame-bearing 40 states: {:numbered 37, :refused 3, :max-work 125296} failures: 0\ncounterexample-search with children 20 states: {:numbered 19, :refused 1, :max-work 308801} failures: 0\ncounterexample-search incidence families 100 states: {:numbered 74, :refused 26, :max-work 421748} failures: 0\nSKIP host-collapse: slash-crossed identifiers remain distinct on JVM\n\nRan 242 tests containing 6311 assertions.\n0 failures, 0 errors.\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
